{"lines":[{"t":"Reading","x":0.77203677311092023,"w":0.074405943552653064,"h":0.015693867198897427,"y":0.070291244726239377,"c":1},{"x":0.086466167612873429,"t":"Steam ships posed a growing threat to clippers, as their speed and cargo capacity increased. In","h":0.016097875080489321,"y":0.1162266579362301,"c":1,"w":0.73120300292968754},{"w":0.72556391398111986,"t":"addition, the opening of the Suez Canal in 1869, the same year that Cutty Sark was launched,","x":0.086466163216706873,"y":0.1336123629086835,"h":0.017707662588538287,"c":1},{"w":0.73120300292968743,"h":0.015988372635703185,"y":0.15116279042400382,"t":"had a serious impact. While steam ships could make use of the quick, direct route between the","x":0.08646616760149925,"c":1},{"x":0.086466155411275544,"y":0.16860465088868448,"c":1,"w":0.74812032063802081,"h":0.015988372635703296,"t":"Mediterranean and the Red Sea, the canal was of no use to sailing ships, which needed the much"},{"t":"stronger winds of the oceans, and so had to sail a far greater distance. Steam ships reduced the","h":0.016142799711503786,"x":0.086466177567432106,"y":0.1860465113542088,"w":0.73308268229166662,"c":1},{"w":0.55838628133138024,"c":1,"y":0.20155602462079103,"x":0.084513688978294962,"h":0.019550344365224959,"t":"journey time between Britain and China by approximately two months."},{"x":0.086466164366912415,"y":0.23824855123143518,"w":0.71616541544596346,"h":0.017707662588538398,"t":"By 1878, tea traders weren't interested in Cutty Sark, and instead, she took on the much less","c":1},{"y":0.25581395335719992,"h":0.017527965292651215,"c":1,"w":0.72556391398111975,"x":0.086466163216207023,"t":"prestigious work of carrying any cargo between any two ports in the world. In 1880, violence"},{"t":"aboard the ship led ultimately to the replacement of the captain with an incompetent drunkard","x":0.086466173137404692,"w":0.72744359334309894,"h":0.017471810271489696,"y":0.27325581382178765,"c":1},{"y":0.28714691993464569,"t":"who stole the crew's wages. He was suspended from service, and a new captain appointed. This","x":0.086381269548597192,"w":0.74266850789388028,"c":1,"h":0.02228053400613228},{"t":"marked a turnaround and the beginning of the most successful period in Cutty Sark's working","y":0.30811332928037816,"x":0.086466173181974568,"w":0.72744359334309894,"h":0.017468066194022192,"c":1},{"h":0.020582486488553542,"c":1,"x":0.086385373326062623,"w":0.72197535196940099,"y":0.32455544260321645,"t":"life, transporting wool from Australia to Britain. One such journey took just under 12 weeks,"},{"x":0.084586463965803771,"c":1,"y":0.34447674419650254,"t":"beating every other ship sailing that year by around a month.","h":0.019013275274214148,"w":0.4755639139811198},{"t":"The ship's next captain, Richard Woodget, was an excellent navigator, who got the best out of","x":0.08646615768035161,"w":0.72932332356770835,"y":0.37926593700810762,"h":0.017536388699346706,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.017707662588538398,"y":0.39665164183820001,"t":"both his ship and his crew. As a sailing ship, Cutty Sark depended on the strong trade winds of the","x":0.086466164168880269,"w":0.75939849853515617},{"y":0.41424418603656787,"w":0.75563908894856768,"h":0.018895348808647294,"x":0.086466170462095607,"c":1,"t":"southern hemisphere, and Woodget took her further south than any previous captain, bringing her"},{"y":0.43126883264760796,"t":"dangerously close to icebergs off the southern tip of South America. His gamble paid off, though,","w":0.75763727823893234,"x":0.086407147757238262,"c":1,"h":0.019633490273204823},{"y":0.44896733496735464,"w":0.50956431070963548,"c":1,"h":0.019253012908326372,"t":"and the ship was the fastest vessel in the wool trade for ten years.","x":0.086383148671777696},{"x":0.086466156575188413,"t":"As competition from steam ships increased in the 1890s, and Cutty Sark approached the end of","w":0.73872182210286463,"c":1,"y":0.48390212471614247,"h":0.017707662588538287},{"h":0.017451219994716216,"t":"her life expectancy, she became less profitable. She was sold to a Portuguese firm, which renamed","x":0.084586474867221664,"w":0.76127817789713537,"c":1,"y":0.50289761734095151},{"y":0.52028332278481093,"h":0.017507375015877846,"t":"her Ferreira. For the next 25 years, she again carried miscellaneous cargoes around the world.","w":0.73308268229166673,"c":1,"x":0.084586478308566859},{"y":0.55523255786611303,"w":0.74060150146484383,"c":1,"t":"Badly damaged in a gale in 1922, she was put into Falmouth harbour in southwest England, for","h":0.015988372635703185,"x":0.086466166464868294},{"c":1,"h":0.01747368200318089,"w":0.74436091105143232,"x":0.084586461678007457,"y":0.57267441847381462,"t":"repairs. Wilfred Dowman, a retired sea captain who owned a training vessel, recognised her and"},{"h":0.01744186072217524,"x":0.084586464897342353,"w":0.75939849853515629,"c":1,"t":"tried to buy her, but without success. She returned to Portugal and was sold to another Portuguese","y":0.59011627893837859},{"h":0.017466194462330997,"t":"company. Dowman was determined, however, and offered a high price: this was accepted, and","x":0.084586478315705066,"y":0.60753380566351511,"w":0.73308268229166662,"c":1},{"t":"the ship returned to Falmouth the following year and had her original name restored.","x":0.084586475608050812,"y":0.62354651145323459,"h":0.018895348808647183,"w":0.65977442423502608,"c":1},{"x":0.084586461671323429,"y":0.65988372079942614,"c":1,"h":0.017514862556727739,"t":"Dowman used Cutty Sark as a training ship, and she continued in this role after his death. When","w":0.74436091105143232},{"c":1,"x":0.084586476205712038,"w":0.70864659627278648,"h":0.017458706921480993,"y":0.67732558126215581,"t":"she was no longer required, in 1954, she was transferred to dry dock at Greenwich to go on"},{"x":0.084586458405934858,"y":0.69476744172912241,"h":0.01744186072217524,"c":1,"w":0.72932332356770835,"t":"public display. The ship suffered from fire in 2007, and again, less seriously, in 2014, but now"},{"t":"Cutty Sark attracts a quarter of a million visitors a year.","y":0.71216999336878373,"w":0.43233083089192714,"h":0.017481169544030895,"x":0.086466163397744961,"c":1},{"x":0.81954887221917927,"y":0.93023255842078634,"t":"83","c":1,"w":0.026315789222717267,"h":0.015988371407532842}],"w":2400,"h":3106}